 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Dense range of a prime-spectrum map is detected on minimal primes",
 "statement": "Let $R$ and $S$ be commutative rings and let $f:R\\to S$ be a ring homomorphism. The map on prime spectra [def-weil-affine-spectrum] induced by contraction has dense range if and only if every minimal prime $I$ of $R$ is the contraction of some prime ideal of $S$.",
